<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korean won hits all time low of 901.00.</title>
<headline>S.Korean won hits all time low of 901.00.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean won hit an all-time low of 901.00 against the dollar in early Tuesday trading, dealers said.  </p>
<p>Dealers said aggressive buying from merchant banks to cover dollar shortages and corporate import settlements pushed the won to the record low level.</p>
<p>The previous all time low of 899.80 was marked on March 31.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
